Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Makes agexplorer.exe, the copy of explorer.exe with the Afterglow Start orb and menu banner, the shell. Delete the value (or set it back to
; explorer.exe) for the stock Start button; the stock explorer.exe stays on the disk.
;
